Cell["\<\
An undriven two-level Hamiltonian is recovered from its three-sector Floquet \
representation.\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->552919480,ExpressionUUID->"8e59ad54-7d8b-514b-81cf-c94b5dd9444d"],

